Aha! `type` (the class itself) has a `__call__` method!
`type.__call__` is the method that handles instantiation.
And `type.__call__.__globals__` is the globals of the `type` class, not the globals of the `ClassDependency` class.

So I should check `inspect.isclass(unwrapped)` BEFORE `hasattr(unwrapped, "__call__")`.

